    "santali_translit": "Napay kurumutu! Aar middhaw chesta me.",
    "category": "check-in",
    "fln_component": "Oral Language Development",
    "source": "bhashini_web_manual",
    "verified": false
  },
  {
    "id": "P047",
    "hindi": "शानदार काम! आज तुम्हें एक स्टार मिलेगा।",
    "santali": "ᱩᱰᱤ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ! ᱛᱮᱦᱮᱧ ᱟᱢ ᱢᱤᱫᱴᱟᱹᱝ ᱥᱴᱟᱨ ᱮᱢ ᱧᱟᱢᱟ",
    "santali_translit": "Adi napay kami! Tehenj am midtang star em nyama.",
    "category": "check-in",
    "fln_component": "Oral Language Development",
    "source": "bhashini_web_manual",
    "verified": false
  },
  {
